<view class="page">
<view class="eyebrow">BETTER TOGETHER</view><view class="title">好球，和好友一起</view><view class="sub">本地球友名册，同组记分无需注册</view><view class="card space"><view class="row"><input class="grow" maxlength="16" placeholder="输入球友昵称" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="add">添加</button></view></view><view class="section">我的球友 · {{friends.length}}</view><view class="card row" wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">下次一起出发</view></view><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="rename">编辑</text><text class="danger small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">移除</text></view><view wx:if="!friends.length" class="empty">添加一位球友，让下一轮更精彩。</view><view class="footer-note">修改名册不会改变已有球局中的球友姓名</view>
</view>
